Below is one possible fix to ensure that toggling the multi‐instance loop on an activity will properly surface a visual update (and thus be picked up when you serialize back out to XML with or without the `isSequential` attribute). In short, we need to teach the `UpdateModdlePropertiesHandler` that when the **moddle element** is a `MultiInstanceLoopCharacteristics`, we should find its owning shapes and mark them as changed so that the DI (and export) is kept in sync.

